  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Written as a children's tale about a rabbit and a farmer, the story is emblematic of a lynching.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">The text is printed in red. The illustrations are cut-outs of knives and hand-held tools, printed on translucent paper and fastened to the pages. The reader is required to lift the tool to read the story.</subfield>
